%% One support-assistant request end to end: identity, guardrails, document ACLs, citations, audit (RAG-03, MLO-09, AGT-06).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Support agent
  participant App as Support assistant<br/>(service.support_assistant)
  participant IdP as Enterprise IdP
  participant GW as AI gateway
  participant GR as Guardrails
  participant DSE as Data Search Engine<br/>(service.knowledge_index)
  participant NIM as NIM LLM on PowerEdge XE
  participant LOG as Audit log / SIEM
  A->>App: Question
  App->>IdP: Validate SSO token, get groups
  IdP-->>App: user = agent, groups = [service, emea]
  App->>GW: Request + user identity
  GW->>GR: Input check (prompt injection, PII)
  GR-->>GW: allowed
  GW->>DSE: Hybrid search, filter acl IN user groups
  DSE-->>GW: Top chunks the user may read, with sources
  GW->>NIM: Prompt with permitted chunks only
  NIM-->>GW: Draft answer
  GW->>GR: Output check (grounded, cites sources, no PII)
  GR-->>GW: allowed
  GW-->>App: Answer + citations
  App-->>A: Answer with links to source documents
  GW->>LOG: user, model version, chunk ids, tokens, guardrail results
